OL,3,GNEWSAPolice commissioner will fight RAF
OL,4,Abase asylum plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police and crime commissioner (PCC)
OL,7,Fsaid he would fight government plans to
OL,8,Fturn a former RAF base into
OL,9,Faccommodation for asylum seekers.
OL,11,FSuffolk and Norfolk police currently
OL,12,Flease RAF Barnham near Thetford for
OL,13,Fspecialist training programmes, and had
OL,14,Fmade plans to buy the site.
OL,16,FSpeaking at the Conservative party
OL,17,Fconference, Suffolk's PCC Tim Passmore
OL,18,Ftold the BBC: "I was astonished when we
OL,19,Fsuddenly heard from the Home Office
OL,20,Fthey wanted to use it as an asylum
OL,21,Fcentre."
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
